72 |     inputs   { v: Vec3; }
   |                   ^^^^ 0 given
   = note: `checks.Checks#Vec3` declares 1 unit parameter: `U`
   = help: write `Vec3(unit)` — a record binds its units at every reference, since it is never instantiated (§5.2)

